    "description": "### Impact\r\nCustom emoji names restored from a crafted backup can make the emoji export write files outside its temporary directory. Only sites with `allow_restore` enabled are affected.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nKeep `allow_restore` disabled, and only restore backups from trusted sources.\n\nDiscovered by Anthropic's OSS Scanner, as vulnerability ANT-2026-UWH9VBAK.",
